
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="it">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-
scale=1.0, maximum-scale=5.0, user-scalable=yes">
  <title>Le mie poesie — Roberto Battaggia</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; 
background-color: #f6f4ef; color: #2c2a29; margin: 0; padding: 
16px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .container { max-width: 860px; margin: 16px auto; 
background: #ffffff; padding: 26px 20px; border-radius: 12px; 
box-shadow: 0 4px 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); border-top: 6px solid 
#4a3f35; }
    .top-link { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 14px; 
color: #6b5e55; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; }
    h1 { text-align: center; font-size: 1.9rem; margin: 4px 0 
8px 0; color: #2c221e; }
    .note { text-align: center; font-size: 0.98rem; color: 
#554e49; background: #faf8f5; padding: 12px; border-radius: 
8px; border: 1px solid #e6e0d6; margin-bottom: 22px; }
    .poem-list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0 0 24px 
0; }
    .poem-item { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-
content: space-between; align-items: center; padding: 14px 
16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ece6dc; gap: 10px; }
    .poem-title { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: bold; color: 
#3a2e25; }
    .btn-group { display: flex; gap: 10px; }
    .btn { text-decoration: none; padding: 8px 14px; border-
radius: 6px; font-size: 0.92rem; font-family: sans-serif; 
cursor: pointer; border: none; }
    .btn-view { background: #4a3f35; color: #ffffff; }
    .btn-full { background: #eae3d9; color: #2c221e; }
    .viewer-box { margin-top: 20px; border: 2px solid #dfd8ce; 
border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; background: #525659; }
    .viewer-bar { background: #4a3f35; color: #fff; padding: 
10px 14px; font-family: sans-serif; font-size: 0.95rem; 
display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: 
center; }


    iframe { width: 100%; height: 78vh; border: none; display: 
block; }
    .footer { text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid 
#e6e0d6; padding-top: 18px; margin-top: 26px; font-size: 
0.92rem; color: #6b5e55; }
    .counter { margin-top: 10px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <a class="top-link" href="index.html">&larr; Torna alla 
pagina principale</a>
    <h1>Le mie poesie</h1>
    <div class="note">Tutte le poesie sono in formato A4. Su 
cellulare puoi usare Apri a schermo intero per scorrere e 
ingrandire con due dita.</div>
    <ul class="poem-list">
      <li class="poem-item">
        <span class="poem-title">1) Venezia</span>
        <div class="btn-group">
          <button class="btn btn-view" 
onclick="apriPoesia('01_Venezia.pdf', '1) Venezia')">Leggi 
qui</button>
          <a class="btn btn-full" href="01_Venezia.pdf" 
target="_blank">Apri a schermo intero</a>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <div class="viewer-box" id="box-lettura">
      <div class="viewer-bar"><span id="titolo-
corrente">Anteprima: 1) Venezia</span></div>
      <iframe id="pdf-frame" src="01_Venezia.pdf"></iframe>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <div>&copy; Roberto Battaggia — Tutti i diritti 
riservati.</div>
      <div class="counter">
        <img src="https://hits.seeyoufarm.com/api/count/incr/
badge.svg?url=https%3A%2F%2Froberto-battaggia-
archive.github.io%2Fpoesie.html&count_bg=%234A3F35&title_bg=%23
8C735B&icon=&icon_color=%23E7E7E7&title=Visite+poesie&edge_flat
=false" alt="Contatore visite poesie"/>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script>
    function apriPoesia(file, titolo) {
      document.getElementById('pdf-frame').src = file;
      document.getElementById('titolo-corrente').textContent = 
'Anteprima: ' + titolo;
      document.getElementById('box-
lettura').scrollIntoView({behavior: 'smooth'});


    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>
